  "title": "Stephen&#39;s Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "I created this recipe for my father on his birthday. It contains lots of different chocolates and nuts. Thanks Dad for sending me to cookie baking school at the San Francisco Culinary Academy! This one is just for you!",
  "authors": [
    "Wendy Peppel"
